<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<TimeML xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="TimeML_1.2.1.xsd">
  <DOCID>begona</DOCID>
  <TIMEX3 tid="t0" type="DATE" value="2018-03-01T00:00:00" functionInDocument="CREATION_TIME" temporalFunction="false">2018-03-01</TIMEX3>
  <TEXT>Arantzazuk, 12 urteko emakumeak, <EVENT eid="e1" class="OCCURRENCE">eskoliosi</EVENT> idiopatikoa du (Cobb <EVENT eid="e2" class="OCCURRENCE">angelua</EVENT> 25º). <EVENT eid="e3" class="OCCURRENCE">Kortsea</EVENT> darama. <TIMEX3 tid="t1" type="DURATION" value="PXM" temporalFunction="true">Azken hilabeteetan</TIMEX3> behin eta berriro <EVENT eid="e4" class="OCCURRENCE">gerturatu</EVENT> da bere familia-medikuaren kontsultara gerriko eta buruko <EVENT eid="e5" class="OCCURRENCE">mina</EVENT> duelako. Ohiko <EVENT eid="e6" class="OCCURRENCE">analgesiaz</EVENT> gain, <EVENT eid="e7" class="OCCURRENCE">Naproxeno</EVENT> 550/12 orduro <EVENT eid="e8" class="OCCURRENCE">gehitu</EVENT> zitzaion. <TIMEX3 tid="t2" type="DATE" value="2018-03-01" temporalFunction="false">Gaur</TIMEX3> berriro <EVENT eid="e9" class="OCCURRENCE">etorri</EVENT> da eta oraindik <EVENT eid="e10" class="OCCURRENCE">min</EVENT> handiarekin dagoela <EVENT eid="e11" class="REPORTING">dio</EVENT>. <EVENT eid="e12" class="OCCURRENCE">Miaketa</EVENT> fisikoan ez da ezer <EVENT eid="e13" class="REPORTING">antzematen</EVENT>. Eskolan soinketako klaseetara ez <EVENT eid="e14" class="OCCURRENCE">joateko</EVENT> ziurtagiria <EVENT eid="e15" class="OCCURRENCE">eskatu</EVENT> digu.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e16" class="OCCURRENCE">Susmoa</EVENT> dugu zerbait <EVENT eid="e17" class="OCCURRENCE">ezkutatzen</EVENT> ari dela eta kontsultara horrenbeste <EVENT eid="e18" class="OCCURRENCE">etortzearen</EVENT> arrazoia beste <EVENT eid="e19" class="OCCURRENCE">bat</EVENT> dela.&#13;
Hori dela-eta, <EVENT eid="e20" class="OCCURRENCE">galdera</EVENT> irekiak egiten dizkiogu eta <EVENT eid="e21" class="OCCURRENCE">minaren</EVENT> arrazoia bere <EVENT eid="e22" class="OCCURRENCE">iritziz</EVENT> zeren baitan dagoen <EVENT eid="e23" class="OCCURRENCE">galdetzen</EVENT> diogu. Pixkanaka kortseak <EVENT eid="e24" class="OCCURRENCE">eramateak</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e25" class="OCCURRENCE">sortzen</EVENT> dion <EVENT eid="e26" class="OCCURRENCE">saminaz</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e27" class="OCCURRENCE">hitz</EVENT> egiten du. Besteen aurrean <EVENT eid="e28" class="OCCURRENCE">arraro</EVENT> eta <EVENT eid="e29" class="OCCURRENCE">desberdin</EVENT> sentitzen delako eta soinketako klasean ez duelako arroparik <EVENT eid="e30" class="OCCURRENCE">kendu</EVENT> nahi, ikaskideek kortsea ez <EVENT eid="e31" class="OCCURRENCE">ikusteko</EVENT>.&#13;
Gaixoari kortsea eramatearen eta ez eramatearen <EVENT eid="e32" class="STATE">onura</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e33" class="STATE">kalte</EVENT> eta <EVENT eid="e34" class="STATE">ondorioak</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e35" class="REPORTING">azaltzen</EVENT> dizkiogu, eta <EVENT eid="e36" class="OCCURRENCE">sortzen</EVENT> dizkion <EVENT eid="e37" class="OCCURRENCE">arazoen</EVENT> aurrean kortsea <EVENT eid="e38" class="OCCURRENCE">kentzea</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e39" class="OCCURRENCE">erabakitzen</EVENT> dugu.</TEXT>
